  "sections": {
    "pf-4cf54b02": {
      "type": "pf-4cf54b02",
      "settings": {
        "pf_ae9d1fb1_value": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <a href=\"/pages/support-center\" target=\"_self\">Support Center</a> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com",
        "pf_d4c6cef6_value": "For computers (Mac or PC):<br>ThePhotoStick® Omni does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.It comes with everything it needs. Just simply plug it into an available USB slot, and you’re ready to get started.<br><br>For phones (Android or iOS):<br>ThePhotoStick® Omni offers a FREE app that allows you to back up, view, and organize your photos with ease.There are no monthly charges or download costs for using the app – just download it and follow the on-screen instructions to easily get started.",
        "pf_9101f560_value": "We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, we are happy to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our Returns and Refunds page. ",
        "pf_c45d2387_value": "Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:<br><br>8GB - 3,500 photos<br>64GB - 25,600 photos<br>128GB - 51,200 photos<br><br><em>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size. For more in-depth information regarding ThePhotoStick Omni, check out our Official User Guide.</em>",
        "pf_cb552e54_value": "My teenager used up all our shared iCloud space with pictures, so we bought him this to save them to thumb drives instead. It has saved us from having to buy more cloud storage! My son says it’s easy to use. The only problem we have is that it doesn’t plug in well when his phone is in his Otterbox case. The phone has to be removed to plug the device in fully.",
        "pf_ee74d8db_value": "Discover the latest in data storage technology with ThePhotoStick Omni. Small yet powerful, it is designed to be durable. It's compatible with ALL of your favorite devices, making it adaptable to your everyday needs. <br><br>Experience top-notch performance and reliable protection for all your important files and memories with ThePhotoStick Omni.",
        "pf_67983d30_value": "This versatile storage solution&nbsp;securely backs up photos, videos, and other files from ALL of your devices, including Windows, macOS, iOS, and Android tablets and smartphones.&nbsp;Download the FREE app from Google Play or the Apple App Store to experience effortless organization, preservation, and sharing of your cherished moments.",
        "pf_3e0458e6_value": "It is simple to backup my photos from multiple devices. One option I like is to restore only selected photos back onto the device. By using this option I can quickly 'Select All' to remove all the original from my iPhone. Then sometimes is useful to have some of the older photos or videos back on my iPhone with me. That is easy to do.",
        "pf_14c54495_value": "This depends on how many photos and videos you have.<br><br>- The 128GB version can hold up to 51,200 photos and videos, which will be plenty for most people.<br><br>- The 256GB version holds up to roughly 102,400 photos and videos, giving you all the storage you'll ever need, perfect for large families with lots of memories.",
        "pf_1661ec55_value": "Had tried numerous times coping from the iPhone to windows laptop and the darn interface woul d fail and never complete the copy. I think it done on purpose by Apple so you end up using a Mac. Bought the photo stick and it did a great job coping all 2500 photos and over 400 videos. Sure beats using Mac. A 1000 thank you !!",
        "pf_53842294_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni works with all modern computers, smartphones, tablets, and computers right out of the box.<br><br>It's also compatible with all Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br><br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and newer<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later<br>- Android: 8.0 and later",
        "pf_76362031_value": "Of course!&nbsp;Visit our website, thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST<br>",
        "pf_77bcfca9_value": "We are dedicated to ensuring that every customer of ThePhotoStick Omni is delighted. We're so confident that you'll love it that we offer a no-risk 30-day Money-Back Guarantee from the day of delivery.<br>",
        "pf_a34d3161_value": "No need to worry about data loss due to expensive subscriptions or virus infections. ThePhotoStick Omni is ideal for organizing digital files and helps you easily manage and locate your data as needed.",
        "pf_51aa9819_value": "ThePhotoStick Omni is the original, trusted solution for effortlessly backing up and organizing your photos and videos. Don't be fooled by knock-offs; choose the trusted name in memory management.",
        "pf_1fc05c27_value": "I already have The PhotoStick and bought this one as a gift after my friend lost her phone in the bay with ALL of her photos on it. This will keep it from happening again. I love the PhotoStick",
        "pf_0026bf69_value": "ThePhotoStick&nbsp;Omni is&nbsp;perfect for anyone who wants to keep their memories safe and organized WITHOUT all the hassle, time, and money it would cost to do it yourself.",
        "pf_327e1682_value": "Never worry about losing your data due to a subscription renewal or virus infection.&nbsp;With ThePhotoStick Omni, your important data will remain secure for years to come.",
        "pf_9fb6a028_value": "From memorable moments and cherished photos, as long as you have ThePhotoStick Omni, your precious memories will remain safe and ready to share with your loved ones.&nbsp;",
        "pf_17654d23_value": "Discover how ThePhotoStick® Omni can securely back up and organize your photos and videos across multiple devices, ensuring your memories are always safe and accessible.",
        "pf_2558dc47_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 144, 198);\">8GB</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\"></span>",
        "pf_448fd4e5_value": "The photostick is easy to use and makes saving pictures and videos a easy task. The price is worth it for the time it saves you in keeping your memories safe.",
        "pf_58545fbd_value": "It's so easy to use, I'm in my late 60s so I'm not too savvy with this kinda stuff but this was so easy even I can use it by myself. Nice product.",
        "pf_85e045a7_value": "No complicated software installation -&nbsp;Just&nbsp;plug the adapter into your device and&nbsp;download the FREE mobile app.",
        "pf_1ffcc805_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 144, 198);\">128GB</span></span>",
        "pf_ba69bea2_alt": "Experience top-notch performance and reliable protection for all your important files and memories with ThePhotoStick Omni.",
        "pf_3c4411e2_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(1, 164, 239);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(25, 144, 198);\">64GB</span></span>",
        "pf_3af03036_alt": "ThePhotoStick Omni is ideal for organizing digital files and helps you easily manage and locate your data as needed.",
        "pf_f0ac0583_value": "The percentage of new phones, on average, that break in the first two years of use, resulting in possible file loss.",
        "pf_5840ff16_value": "The amount of space 1,000 photos take up on your mobile device, negatively&nbsp;impacting its performance.",
        "pf_8b0cb0a4_value": "With up to 256GB of storage, easily&nbsp;back up over 102,000 photos and videos and easily access&nbsp;",
        "pf_8246040b_value": "Experience seamless file organization and preservation like never before&nbsp;with ThePhotoStick Omni.",
        "pf_a632542c_value": "Sit back and relax as ThePhotoStick Omni searches your device for each and every precious memory",
        "pf_f4dbf1ba_value": "Safely and easily store your precious photo and video memories, no matter where they are.&nbsp;",
        "pf_a47c09c6_value": "Securely back&nbsp;up each file and organize them neatly into folders so they're easy to find.",
